  "body": "I'm the maintainer of the AUR -bin package.  I don't see any reason the described problem should happen.\n\nBefore reporting the issue to nautilus devs, I would recommend creating a new user with default, bare profile (ART not yet installed).  Log in and change nothing except nautilus shortcut.  Confirm shortcut works.  Install ART.  Check whether nautilus shortcut does or doesn't work.",
